{"parse": {"title": "一日之餐", "pageid": 54936, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"一日之餐\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/83/CurrencyItem-100901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"一日之餐\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>一日之餐</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-100901 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/CurrencyIcon-100901_1.png/28px-CurrencyIcon-100901_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/CurrencyIcon-100901_1.png/43px-CurrencyIcon-100901_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/CurrencyIcon-100901_1.png/57px-CurrencyIcon-100901_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"104\" data-file-height=\"88\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#1901</div></div><hr /><div>拉普拉斯内部的特供餐点，一支即可满足一日的营养需求。用于在“茶水间”兑换奖励商品。<br />仅限[孤独之歌]活动举办期间使用。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">糖分、盐分、维生素以及蛋白质，安全且营养丰富，因工作而无暇用餐时的选择，服用后会反胃是难吃导致的，与未公开的成分无关。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "一日之餐"}}